---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="TextKit — Free Online Text Tools, No Signup"
  description="Free online text tools that work instantly in your browser: word counter, case converter, line break remover, and text sorter. No signup, no uploads, no limits."
>
  <section>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Free Online Text Tools</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
      Paste your text and get results instantly — count words, convert letter case, clean up
      line breaks, or sort lists. Every tool is free, needs no signup, and runs entirely in
      your browser, so your text never leaves your device.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <a href="/word-counter" class="block rounded-2xl bg-white border border-zinc-200 p-6 hover:border-zinc-900 transition">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Word Counter</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-600">Count words, characters, sentences, paragraphs, reading time, and keyword density.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/case-converter" class="block rounded-2xl bg-white border border-zinc-200 p-6 hover:border-zinc-900 transition">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Case Converter</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-600">Convert to UPPERCASE, lowercase, Title Case, Sentence case, camelCase, snake_case, or kebab-case.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/remove-line-breaks" class="block rounded-2xl bg-white border border-zinc-200 p-6 hover:border-zinc-900 transition">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Remove Line Breaks</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-600">Strip all newlines, delete blank lines, or replace line breaks with spaces in one click.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/text-sorter" class="block rounded-2xl bg-white border border-zinc-200 p-6 hover:border-zinc-900 transition">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Text Sorter</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-600">Sort lines A–Z or by length, remove duplicates, trim whitespace, and drop empty lines.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 text-sm text-zinc-500">
    <p>
      More AI text tools are on the way: an AI detector and an AI text humanizer.
      Everything here stays free and private — try the
      <a href="/word-counter" class="text-emerald-700 underline">word counter</a> to see.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
